      "text": "We asked, you responded… and grabe, you DID NOT disappoint. 👀🔥\n\nSo eto na nga, mga atecco—get your sneakers ready and your energy UP because this is finally happening! 🏃🏻‍♀️💨\n\nLingOrm Powerhouse PH is bringing the vibes and the community together for a FUN RUN/WALK like no other! 💗✨\n\n📅 Date: April 12, 2026 Sunday, 6:30AM\n📍 Location: Ayala Makati Car Free Sundays, Paseo Center Parking\n🏃🏻‍♀️ Category: 3K Run/Walk\n\n💸 Registration Fee: P100\n\nWhether you’re here to sprint, stroll, or just show up for the fun (and the fandom 😉), this is your moment to be part of something special. Imagine: good energy, great company, and all the LingOrm love in one place. 🫶🏻\n\n🎟️ Register here: https://t.co/DN2GozEFw9\n⏳ Registration Deadline: April 4, 2026\n\nSpots are LIMITED, so don’t walk—RUN (literally 😆) and secure yours now!\n\nMark your calendars, rally your besties, and let’s make this an unforgettable day! 🥳\n\nReady na ba kayo? Because we definitely are. LET’S GOOOOOO! 🚀💖",
